* PedalKernel Diode Models — SPICE .MODEL format
*
* Standard SPICE diode parameters:
*   IS  — Saturation current (A)
*   RS  — Series resistance (Ω)
*   N   — Emission coefficient (ideality factor)
*   TT  — Transit time (s)
*   CJO — Zero-bias junction capacitance (F)
*   VJ  — Junction potential (V)
*   M   — Grading coefficient
*   BV  — Reverse breakdown voltage (V)
*   IBV — Current at BV (A)
*   EG  — Bandgap energy (eV): 1.11=Si, 0.69=Schottky, 0.67=Ge
*   XTI — IS temperature exponent: 3=Si, 2=Schottky
*
* Engineering suffixes: f=1e-15, p=1e-12, n=1e-9, u=1e-6, m=1e-3, k=1e3, MEG=1e6
*
* Sources: MicroCode Engineering, ON Semi, Fairchild, Vishay datasheets

